.TH KUBUX-WALLPAPER-GENERATOR 1 "2025" "kubux-wallpaper-generator" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kubux-wallpaper-generator \- AI-powered wallpaper creation and management tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kubux-wallpaper-generator
.SH DESCRIPTION
kubux-wallpaper-generator is a PySide6-based desktop application for generating,
browsing, and managing wallpapers. It integrates with the Together.ai API for
AI image generation and supports setting wallpapers on multiple Linux desktop
environments (GNOME, KDE, XFCE, Cinnamon, MATE, LXQt, i3, Sway).
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B AI Image Generation
Generate wallpapers from text prompts using Together.ai's FLUX models.
.TP
.B Image Gallery
Browse your wallpaper collection with a virtual thumbnail grid that only
renders visible thumbnails for optimal performance.
.TP
.B Image Viewer
Full-screen image viewer with zoom, pan, and scroll support.
.TP
.B Wallpaper Setting
Set any image as wallpaper with automatic desktop environment detection.
.TP
.B Image Import
Add images from your file system via the built-in file picker dialog.
.TP
.B Prompt History
Save and reuse your generation prompts.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration files are stored in ~/.config/kubux-wallpaper-generator/.
.TP
.B app_settings.json
Window geometry, UI scale, thumbnail scale, and model settings.
.TP
.B prompt_history.json
Saved generation prompts.
.PP
Generated images are stored in ~/Pictures/kubux-wallpaper-generator/.
Thumbnail cache is stored in ~/.cache/kubux-thumbnail-cache/.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TOGETHER_API_KEY
Required for AI image generation. Set in a .env file in your home directory.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/kubux-wallpaper-generator/images/
Symlinks to your wallpaper collection.
.TP
.I ~/Pictures/kubux-wallpaper-generator/
Downloaded generated images.
